== diags.diag/spread-not-sequence
BYN2235 2:22 `..n` spreads a `i32`, which is not a sequence
  label not a `List`, `Span` or fixed array
  help drop the `..` to add `n` as one element
BYN2235 4:25 `..stock` spreads a `Map<string, i32>`, which is not a sequence
  label not a `List`, `Span` or fixed array
  help spread a `List`, `Span` or fixed array; a single value goes in without `..`
